{"id":"v06-13","volume":6,"volumeTitle":"卷六","volumeSubtitle":"汉文","index":13,"title":{"t":"光武帝臨淄勞耿弇","s":"光武帝临淄劳耿弇"},"book":{"t":"東漢文","s":"东汉文"},"sourceHead":{"t":"","s":""},"author":"东汉","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"皇帝的车驾到达临淄，亲自慰劳军队，群臣大规模聚会。","tokens":[{"t":"車","s":"车","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"駕","s":"驾","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"至","s":"至","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"臨","s":"临","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"淄","s":"淄","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"自","s":"自","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"勞","s":"劳","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"軍","s":"军","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"羣","s":"群","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"臣","s":"臣","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"大","s":"大","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"會","s":"会","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"光武帝对耿弇说：从前韩信攻破历下，从而开创基业；如今将军攻下祝阿，从而兴起功业。这两处都是齐地的西部边界，功劳足以相比。","tokens":[{"t":"帝","s":"帝","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"謂","s":"谓","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"弇","s":"弇","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"曰","s":"曰","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"昔","s":"昔","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"韓","s":"韩","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"信","s":"信","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"破","s":"破","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"歷","s":"历","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"下","s":"下","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","ex